(6263680, 926554, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice zoom effect. The distortion on the outer edges draws the eye to the boy in the center making the peace sign. Striking image. I''d love to know the background to this photo.</td>', 'Nice zoom effect. The distortion on the outer edges draws the eye to the boy in the center making the peace sign. Striking image. I''d love to know the background to this photo.', '2010-12-29 10:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
