(6263745, 926842, 120171, '<td valign="top">I did a crop similar to this... it didnt go down too well as it is too small.</td>', 'I did a crop similar to this... it didnt go down too well as it is too small.', '2010-12-29 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263746, 927028, 120171, '<td valign="top">I think your lighting has let you down here.</td>', 'I think your lighting has let you down here.', '2010-12-29 12:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263756, 926717, 120171, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is off the mark and i cant make out if your border is intended or not.<br/>On a positive note that plate must be worth a pretty penny.</td>', 'Your lighting is off the mark and i cant make out if your border is intended or not.On a positive note that plate must be worth a pretty penny.', '2010-12-29 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263757, 926977, 120171, '<td valign="top">i love the colours, would like to see the centre more horizontal.</td>', 'i love the colours, would like to see the centre more horizontal.', '2010-12-29 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263758, 926254, 125385, '<td valign="top">Great expression.  I really like the way you have this cropped.  The whole picture really comes together well. The blurred background really brings the focus to the child while still keeping the whole picture in context.  Really like how you pulled it all together.</td>', 'Great expression.  I really like the way you have this cropped.  The whole picture really comes together well. The blurred background really brings the focus to the child while still keeping the whole picture in context.  Really like how you pulled it all together.', '2010-12-29 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263759, 926254, 69034, '<td valign="top">I find the boogers disturbing.  LOL.  Good shot.</td>', 'I find the boogers disturbing.  LOL.  Good shot.', '2010-12-29 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263762, 926952, 125385, '<td valign="top">Colors! Fantastic capture of the colors.  I really need to get up North to see the lights.  How long of an exposure did you do?  I really like the use of the shadows from the right moving across brings a type of good vs evil feel to this. A small town vs the darkness.</td>', 'Colors! Fantastic capture of the colors.  I really need to get up North to see the lights.  How long of an exposure did you do?  I really like the use of the shadows from the right moving across brings a type of good vs evil feel to this. A small town vs the darkness.', '2010-12-29 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263765, 926945, 125385, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot for black and white.  With the leafless trees the white really makes them pop in contrast with the dark pines.  The clouds are exceptional and work as a natural moving frame for the hill tops.  Great work</td>', 'Perfect shot for black and white.  With the leafless trees the white really makes them pop in contrast with the dark pines.  The clouds are exceptional and work as a natural moving frame for the hill tops.  Great work', '2010-12-29 12:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263766, 926977, 125385, '<td valign="top">Great details captured here. Love the color scheme and how it makes the snowflake pop.</td>', 'Great details captured here. Love the color scheme and how it makes the snowflake pop.', '2010-12-29 12:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263767, 926929, 125385, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture of the light from that lamp post.  Gives an extremely erie feeling yet at the same time a feeling of a light in the darkness.  I really like how you positioned the camera here.  How long of an exposure did you do here to pick up the lights of the sky?</td>', 'Perfect capture of the light from that lamp post.  Gives an extremely erie feeling yet at the same time a feeling of a light in the darkness.  I really like how you positioned the camera here.  How long of an exposure did you do here to pick up the lights of the sky?', '2010-12-29 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263769, 926652, 120171, '<td valign="top">The white of your border at the top left dissaperas into the sky.</td>', 'The white of your border at the top left dissaperas into the sky.', '2010-12-29 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263776, 926655, 83313, '<td valign="top">The HO scale figures (and high quality of photography) gives me a clue as to whose entry this might be.</td>', 'The HO scale figures (and high quality of photography) gives me a clue as to whose entry this might be.', '2010-12-29 12:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263779, 926526, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me very soft looking but not in a positive way, I''m afraid, as if a lot of noise reduction had to be done.</td>', 'Comes off to me very soft looking but not in a positive way, I''m afraid, as if a lot of noise reduction had to be done.', '2010-12-29 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263785, 926904, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh, cool!</td>', 'Oh, cool!', '2010-12-29 12:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263788, 926951, 120171, '<td valign="top">If the snow was whiter as opposed to the sky the shot would stand out more.</td>', 'If the snow was whiter as opposed to the sky the shot would stand out more.', '2010-12-29 12:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263791, 926754, 120171, '<td valign="top">Appears out of focus and a could do with more light.</td>', 'Appears out of focus and a could do with more light.', '2010-12-29 12:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263794, 926729, 83313, '<td valign="top">This might have gotten a high vote from me, but there is nothing in focus in this scene. Sometimes total blur can work, but my eye wants to find a focal point. It reaches the girl and finding her OOF, my eye continues to hunt for a subject.</td>', 'This might have gotten a high vote from me, but there is nothing in focus in this scene. Sometimes total blur can work, but my eye wants to find a focal point. It reaches the girl and finding her OOF, my eye continues to hunt for a subject.', '2010-12-29 12:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263795, 926942, 120171, '<td valign="top">im not sure where i should be looking on this shot, my eyes dart all over the image.</td>', 'im not sure where i should be looking on this shot, my eyes dart all over the image.', '2010-12-29 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263796, 926970, 83313, '<td valign="top">So where''s grandma? Did she also get eaten by the reindeer?</td>', 'So where''s grandma? Did she also get eaten by the reindeer?', '2010-12-29 12:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263799, 926634, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute family photo, but the white balance is way off and hurts it a lot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'A cute family photo, but the white balance is way off and hurts it a lot, I''m afraid.', '2010-12-29 12:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263805, 926245, 120171, '<td valign="top">Bottom left corner has objects that could have been removed. I like the perspective.</td>', 'Bottom left corner has objects that could have been removed. I like the perspective.', '2010-12-29 12:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263806, 926976, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does not have much impact on me, with regard to fitting the song, I''m afraid. Rather than coming off as a winter wonderland, it conveys a mood of dreariness to me. Sorry.</td>', 'Does not have much impact on me, with regard to fitting the song, I''m afraid. Rather than coming off as a winter wonderland, it conveys a mood of dreariness to me. Sorry.', '2010-12-29 12:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
