(6263844, 926941, 121800, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you ment to have you in the picture but other than that this picture is really cool because it looks like there are 4 instead of two.</td>', 'I don''t know if you ment to have you in the picture but other than that this picture is really cool because it looks like there are 4 instead of two.', '2010-12-29 13:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6263954, 926986, 86447, '<td valign="top">My fave...  (not voting)</td>', 'My fave...  (not voting)', '2010-12-29 14:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264030, 926904, 125385, '<td valign="top">I love this perspective, it is a powerful shot with everything going on but it seems very flat.  It lacks defined shadows and colors.  I think this would have been a 8 or 9 if it was a different time of day that allowed shadows from the boats or the building to be more defined on the ice. <br/>I love this angle so much that I had to give it a 7 at least for the fact that it almost seems like the old generation vs the new.  You have the castle and old sail style boats on the right and middle vs the new cars on the left and town style houses. Great location</td>', 'I love this perspective, it is a powerful shot with everything going on but it seems very flat.  It lacks defined shadows and colors.  I think this would have been a 8 or 9 if it was a different time of day that allowed shadows from the boats or the building to be more defined on the ice. I love this angle so much that I had to give it a 7 at least for the fact that it almost seems like the old generation vs the new.  You have the castle and old sail style boats on the right and middle vs the new cars on the left and town style houses. Great location', '2010-12-29 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264040, 926942, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like this more and more the longer I look at it.  Nice B&amp;W with some beautiful landscape lines.</td>', 'I like this more and more the longer I look at it.  Nice B&W with some beautiful landscape lines.', '2010-12-29 16:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264041, 926869, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice nostalgic feeling to the processing.</td>', 'Nice nostalgic feeling to the processing.', '2010-12-29 16:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264042, 926727, 35513, '<td valign="top">I have to say, this is one of the few "figurine" shots I''ve seen on DPC that I actually like!</td>', 'I have to say, this is one of the few "figurine" shots I''ve seen on DPC that I actually like!', '2010-12-29 16:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264044, 926526, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the starburst effect.</td>', 'I like the starburst effect.', '2010-12-29 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264046, 926576, 35513, '<td valign="top">LOVE the bokeh!</td>', 'LOVE the bokeh!', '2010-12-29 16:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264048, 926867, 35513, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S a snowman!</td>', 'Now THAT''S a snowman!', '2010-12-29 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264093, 927040, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I like the sharp focus and he has a great expression.  Not a strong tie in to the Christmas theme of the song.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I like the sharp focus and he has a great expression.  Not a strong tie in to the Christmas theme of the song.', '2010-12-29 17:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264096, 926941, 91496, '<td valign="top">The Santa hat is a nice touch, alhtough the kitchen is not the greatest choice of a background.  Is the desat of the right side natural -- it looks kind of out of place.</td>', 'The Santa hat is a nice touch, alhtough the kitchen is not the greatest choice of a background.  Is the desat of the right side natural -- it looks kind of out of place.', '2010-12-29 17:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264097, 926444, 91496, '<td valign="top">I see several trees - cool.  The tilt of the wide angle here is not working for me.  The overblown highlights on the left are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I see several trees - cool.  The tilt of the wide angle here is not working for me.  The overblown highlights on the left are a bit distracting.', '2010-12-29 17:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264099, 926402, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus (maybe too soft) and high key look.  I wish this has a 5-10 pixel black border all around rather than the stark white top-bottom which draws my eye away from the model.</td>', 'I like the soft focus (maybe too soft) and high key look.  I wish this has a 5-10 pixel black border all around rather than the stark white top-bottom which draws my eye away from the model.', '2010-12-29 17:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264100, 926380, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like for corner composition. Brave of you to go B&amp;W for the most colorful of characters -- not sure it really works.</td>', 'I like for corner composition. Brave of you to go B&W for the most colorful of characters -- not sure it really works.', '2010-12-29 17:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264103, 926938, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the red bells and the angle you have chosen.  Perhaps there are too many ojects in the scene and background competing for attention.</td>', 'I like the red bells and the angle you have chosen.  Perhaps there are too many ojects in the scene and background competing for attention.', '2010-12-29 17:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264107, 926810, 91496, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely.  My only not would be to have it be darker in the foreground so the tree could "glow" more and it would look more like night.</td>', 'Quite lovely.  My only not would be to have it be darker in the foreground so the tree could "glow" more and it would look more like night.', '2010-12-29 17:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264109, 927028, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the figure.  The backdrop of candy canes is too bright and competes for attention.</td>', 'I like the composition of the figure.  The backdrop of candy canes is too bright and competes for attention.', '2010-12-29 17:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6264114, 926754, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice angles on the subjects.  Good lighting.  Not sure mixing Santa and Jesus is ever a good idea.  Focus is on left bottom of santa and not on the baby.</td>', 'Nice angles on the subjects.  Good lighting.  Not sure mixing Santa and Jesus is ever a good idea.  Focus is on left bottom of santa and not on the baby.', '2010-12-29 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
