(6264929, 926543, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, and the creativity of the "tree." I''m not seeing the "let it snow" here, but that''s ok, I won''t take off.</td>', 'I like this photo, and the creativity of the "tree." I''m not seeing the "let it snow" here, but that''s ok, I won''t take off.', '2010-12-30 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
