(6264933, 926610, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to this with good use of the rule of thirds. The background is a bit complex for me, it takes away from your main subject.</td>', 'Nice idea to this with good use of the rule of thirds. The background is a bit complex for me, it takes away from your main subject.', '2010-12-30 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
