(6270730, 926952, 108069, '<td valign="top">Hell of a view. Super sharp and yet smooth. I wish the foreground were snowy instead of grassy, but that is seriously nitpicky and stupid. Awesome shot.</td>', 'Hell of a view. Super sharp and yet smooth. I wish the foreground were snowy instead of grassy, but that is seriously nitpicky and stupid. Awesome shot.', '2011-01-04 17:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
