(6272217, 926695, 125132, '<td valign="top">Marble statue,<br/>marble ears, <br/>in the midst of noise and chant.<br/>but<br/>the silent statue hears<br/>what we can''t: <br/> <br/>steps of angels on the stone<br/>angels talking on the phone<br/>angels mixing up the drinks<br/>all big smiles and tiny winks<br/>baking cake <br/>as angels make<br/>kissing strangers<br/>on the mouth<br/>spreading good news<br/>North and South<br/>playing sparrow<br/>through the pews<br/>flying planes <br/>so they don''t crash...<br/> <br/>Walls don''t stop them<br/>winds don''t break them<br/>shots don''t take them<br/>eyes don''t see them<br/>but <br/>the statue with stone ears<br/>works them out<br/>from all she hears.<br/></td>', 'Marble statue,marble ears, in the midst of noise and chant.butthe silent statue hearswhat we can''t:  steps of angels on the stoneangels talking on the phoneangels mixing up the drinksall big smiles and tiny winksbaking cake as angels makekissing strangerson the mouthspreading good newsNorth and Southplaying sparrowthrough the pewsflying planes so they don''t crash... Walls don''t stop themwinds don''t break themshots don''t take themeyes don''t see thembut the statue with stone earsworks them outfrom all she hears.', '2011-01-05 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
